This product's report layout and status semantics follow
multiple-cucumber-html-reporter (https://github.com/WasiqB/multiple-cucumber-html-reporter):
the overview dashboard, the feature list, the feature page and the scenario card,
the scenario and feature status rules, and the human-readable duration format
("40ms", "<1ms", "1h 2m 3s", "1d 2h 3m 4s").

No source code, templates, styles, scripts, images or fonts from that project are
included. The templates, CSS, JavaScript and SVG charts in this repository were
written for it. No fragment has been copied; if one is ever copied, its source file
and line range will be listed here.

